<overview>
<p>Conventional infantry within the FWLM serve as the backbone of provincial defense across a patchwork of semi-autonomous states, each maintaining its own military traditions and equipment preferences. Towing crew-served autocannon/2 field guns, these platoons provide long-range direct fire support that supplements a formation's organic firepower. The light caliber offers sustained suppressive fire at extended range, though stopping power against armored targets is limited.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on prototype release of FWL advanced infantry kit
</notes>

